#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Connect for OneDrive: connects Microsoft OneDrive to your Linux desktop via rclone.

- Sign in through the browser (rclone authorize)
- Mount via a systemd user service (~/OneDrive, starts at every login)
- A OneDrive entry in the sidebar of Dolphin (KDE) and GTK file managers
- Checks whether the sign-in is still valid, with 'Sign in again'
- System tray icon with quick menu and notifications on problems
- English and Dutch user interface

Options:  --tray     start only the system tray icon
          --cleanup  remove the service, sidebar entries and autostart

Requirements: Python 3.10+, PySide6, rclone and fuse3 (see install.sh)
"""

